    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "EasyMath is a captivating mobile application designed by INAM KHAN to
    make math learning easy and fun for kids. With its user-friendly interface and
    interactive features, EasyMath aims to foster a love for numbers and boost children's
    mathematical abilities.\r\n\r\nThe app covers a wide range of math topics, including
    addition, subtraction, multiplication, and division. Apart from that EasyMath
    also take quize from the kids to test the kids learning.\r\n\r\nWith EasyMath,
    learning math becomes an enjoyable adventure, empowering children to develop
    strong arithematic skills and build confidence in their mathematical abilities.
    It's an ideal companion for young learners on their math learning journey. \r\n\n\r\nWith
    EasyMath, learning math becomes an enjoyable adventure, empowering children to
    develop strong arithematic skills and build confidence in their mathematical
    abilities. It's an ideal companion for young learners on their math learning
    journey. \r\n\nWith EasyMath, learning math becomes an enjoyable adventure, empowering
    children to develop strong foundational skills and build confidence in their
    mathematical abilities. It's an ideal companion for young learners on their math
    learning journey. \n"
